    "description": "Postman collection for the Event Recommender REST API.\n\nBase URL: http://localhost:8080\nAll endpoints are under /api/v1/events\n\nCategories: MUSIC, SPORTS, ARTS, TECHNOLOGY, FOOD, BUSINESS, EDUCATION, HEALTH, OTHER\n\nError responses follow RFC 7807 Problem Details format:\n- 400 Bad Request — malformed body or invalid enum value\n- 404 Not Found   — event not found\n- 500 Internal Server Error — unexpected error (no stack trace exposed)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
